      "role": "user",
      "content": "A \"mischievous troll\"? That's a weird way to put it lol. Anyway, I don't really care about the metaphors, I just need to know which is actually faster. If I look at the options through Doha vs. a direct flight from a different London airport, how do I calculate which one is more reliable right now with all this chaos?",
